### Feature OrderItem — GET ALL / GET ONE
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "Jaider",
  "password": "23456789"
}

###
# @name getAllOrderItems
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-pedidos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name getOneOrderItem
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-pedidos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 400 — id inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-pedidos/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 404 — no existe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-pedidos/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
